WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.230
Look at two short sentences.

2
00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.510
Veo la casa.

3
00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:04.890
"I see the house.

4
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.150
" Veo a María.

5
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.670
"I see María.

6
00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:08.690
" Same verb.

7
00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:10.550
Same meaning of "I see".

8
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.890
But the second sentence
has an extra word, a,

9
00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:16.430
and English has nothing in that spot.

10
00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:19.530
Why does it appear in one
sentence and not the other?

11
00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.590
In this mission, you'll learn
the little linking words,

12
00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:26.680
like con, "with", and sin, "without".

13
00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:30.710
You'll say "my father's
car" without an apostrophe,

14
00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:33.850
and see two tiny words merge into one.

15
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:38.730
Your mission: work out when
Spanish slips in that extra a.
